Template: homelab-mailbridge/db_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PostgreSQL host to bootstrap this app's roles/schema on:
 Used only once, at first install, to run homelab-bootstrap-app-role.
 This app has no tables of its own -- the only thing it uses this for
 is a narrow INSERT-only grant on audit.queue (see homelab-audit) for
 the mail-send audit trail.

Template: homelab-mailbridge/pgbouncer_host
Type: string
Default: localhost
Description: PgBouncer host to register this app's runtime role with:
 Used only once, at first install. Also written into config.yml's
 database.host, so the running service connects through the pooler.

Template: homelab-mailbridge/homelab_api_base_url
Type: string
Default: http://127.0.0.1:3000
Description: Base URL where homelab-api is reachable:
 Written into config.yml's homelab_api.base_url -- every request this
 app handles is authenticated by introspecting the caller's JWT here.

Template: homelab-mailbridge/imap_host
Type: string
Default: mail.test.mailmasker.org
Description: IMAP host (homelab-dovecot):

Template: homelab-mailbridge/imap_port
Type: string
Default: 993
Description: IMAP port:

Template: homelab-mailbridge/smtp_host
Type: string
Default: mail.test.mailmasker.org
Description: SMTP submission host (homelab-postfix):

Template: homelab-mailbridge/smtp_port
Type: string
Default: 587
Description: SMTP submission port:

Template: homelab-mailbridge/listen_port
Type: string
Default: 2510
Description: Port for homelab-mailbridge to listen on:
